    {
      "source": "Because our domain repository extends <code>ReactiveCrudRepository</code>, it provides you with reactive CRUD operations to access the entities.\nOn top of <code>ReactiveCrudRepository</code>, there is also <code>ReactiveSortingRepository</code>, which adds additional sorting functionality similar to that of <code>PagingAndSortingRepository</code>.\nWorking with the repository instance is merely a matter of dependency injecting it into a client.\nConsequently, you can retrieve all <code>Person</code> objects with the following code:",
      "translation": "由于我们的领域仓库扩展了 `<code>ReactiveCrudRepository</code>`，因此它提供了用于访问实体的响应式 CRUD 操作。\n在 `<code>ReactiveCrudRepository</code>` 之上，还有 `<code>ReactiveSortingRepository</code>`，它添加了类似于 `<code>PagingAndSortingRepository</code>` 的额外排序功能。\n与仓库实例协作只需将其依赖注入到客户端中即可。\n因此，您可以使用以下代码检索所有 `<code>Person</code>` 对象：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that <code>@EnableR2dbcRepositories</code> allows configuration through <code>entityOperationsRef</code>.\nUsing various <code>DatabaseClient</code> beans is useful when connecting to multiple databases of the same type.\nWhen using different database systems that differ in their dialect, use <code>@EnableR2dbcRepositories(entityOperationsRef = …)</code> instead.",
      "translation": "请注意，<code>@EnableR2dbcRepositories</code> 支持通过 <code>entityOperationsRef</code> 进行配置。  \n当需要连接到多个同类型的数据库时，使用多种 <code>DatabaseClient</code> Bean 非常有用。  \n如果使用的是方言不同的不同数据库系统，则应改用 <code>@EnableR2dbcRepositories(entityOperationsRef = …)</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "When working with multiple, potentially different databases, your application will require a different approach to configuration.\nThe provided <code>AbstractR2dbcConfiguration</code> support class assumes a single <code>ConnectionFactory</code> from which the <code>Dialect</code> gets derived.\nThat being said, you need to define a few beans yourself to configure Spring Data R2DBC to work with multiple databases.",
      "translation": "在与多个（可能不同的）数据库一起工作时，您的应用程序需要采用不同的配置方法。  \n提供的 <code>AbstractR2dbcConfiguration</code> 支持类假设存在单个 <code>ConnectionFactory</code>，并由此派生出 <code>Dialect</code>。  \n尽管如此，您需要自行定义一些 Bean，以配置 Spring Data R2DBC 使其能够与多个数据库协同工作。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "R2DBC repositories require <code>R2dbcEntityOperations</code> to implement repositories.\nA simple configuration to scan for repositories without using <code>AbstractR2dbcConfiguration</code> looks like:",
      "translation": "R2DBC 仓库需要实现 <code>R2dbcEntityOperations</code> 接口。  \n一种不使用 <code>AbstractR2dbcConfiguration</code> 来扫描仓库的简单配置如下：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This chapter points out the specialties for repository support for R2DBC.\nThis builds on the core repository support explained in <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../repositories/introduction.html\">Working with Spring Data Repositories</a>.\nBefore reading this chapter, you should have a sound understanding of the basic concepts explained there.",
      "translation": "本章介绍了 R2DBC 存储库支持的特性。\n该内容建立在<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../repositories/introduction.html\">使用 Spring Data 存储库</a>中解释的核心存储库支持基础之上。\n在阅读本章之前，您应该对其中解释的基本概念有扎实的理解。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "To access domain entities stored in a relational database, you can use our sophisticated repository support that eases implementation quite significantly.\nTo do so, create an interface for your repository.\nConsider the following <code>Person</code> class:",
      "translation": "要访问关系型数据库中存储的领域实体，您可以使用我们功能强大的仓储支持，这将显著简化实现过程。\n为此，请为您的仓储创建接口。\n考虑以下<code>Person</code>类：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following example shows a repository interface for the preceding <code>Person</code> class:",
      "translation": "以下示例展示了前述 `<code>Person</code>` 类的存储库接口：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "To configure R2DBC repositories, you can use the <code>@EnableR2dbcRepositories</code> annotation.\nIf no base package is configured, the infrastructure scans the package of the annotated configuration class.\nThe following example shows how to use Java configuration for a repository:",
      "translation": "要配置 R2DBC 仓库，可以使用 `<code>@EnableR2dbcRepositories</code>` 注解。  \n如果未配置基础包，基础设施将扫描该注解配置类所在的包。  \n以下示例展示了如何使用 Java 配置来定义一个仓库：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The preceding example creates an application context with Spring’s unit test support, which performs annotation-based dependency injection into test cases.\nInside the test method, we use the repository to query the database.\nWe use <code>StepVerifier</code> as a test aid to verify our expectations against the results.",
      "translation": "前面的示例使用 Spring 的单元测试支持创建了应用程序上下文，该支持会向测试用例执行基于注解的依赖注入。  \n在测试方法中，我们使用该仓库查询数据库。  \n我们使用 <code>StepVerifier</code> 作为测试辅助工具，以验证我们的预期与实际结果是否一致。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A query method returning an Interface- or DTO projection is backed by results produced by the actual query.\nInterface projections generally rely on mapping results onto the domain type first to consider potential <code>@Column</code> type mappings and the actual projection proxy uses a potentially partially materialized entity to expose projection data.",
      "translation": "返回接口或 DTO 投影的查询方法由实际查询产生的结果支撑。接口投影通常首先将结果映射到域类型，以考虑潜在的 `<code>@Column</code>` 类型映射，而实际的投影代理则使用可能部分实体化的对象来暴露投影数据。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "String-based queries use a different approach since the actual query, specifically the field projection, and result type declaration are close together.\nDTO projections used with query methods annotated with <code>@Query</code> map query results directly into the DTO type.\nField mappings on the domain type are not considered.\nUsing the DTO type directly, your query method can benefit from a more dynamic projection that isn’t restricted to the domain model.",
      "translation": "基于字符串的查询采用不同的方法，因为实际查询（特别是字段投影）和结果类型声明彼此紧密相邻。  \n使用带有 <code>@Query</code> 注解的查询方法时，DTO 投影会将查询结果直接映射到 DTO 类型。  \n不考虑领域类型上的字段映射。  \n直接使用 DTO 类型，您的查询方法可以受益于更动态的投影，而不再受限于领域模型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Result mapping for DTO projections depends on the actual query type.\nDerived queries use the domain type to map results, and Spring Data creates DTO instances solely from properties available on the domain type.\nDeclaring properties in your DTO that are not available on the domain type is not supported.",
      "translation": "DTO 投影的结果映射取决于实际的查询类型。派生查询使用域类型来映射结果，Spring Data 仅根据域类型上可用的属性创建 DTO 实例。在 DTO 中声明域类型上不可用的属性是不受支持的。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
